{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And there was strife between the herdsmen of Abram's cattle and the herdsmen of Lot's cattle.</b> There was strife among them over who would yield before whom from the pasture they would find." "<b>And the Canaanite and the Perizzite were then dwelling in the land.</b> And therefore the strife between two brothers who were sojourners made their reputation odious in the eyes of the inhabitants — for when there is strife between sojourning brothers, the inhabitants consider them quarrelsome men, and they will draw an a fortiori inference on their own."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:58.614153912Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}